<div id="A3.SS4.p8" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS4.p8.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A3.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ C.4 Orthogonality ‣ Appendix C CreditDecoding Supplement ‣ CreditDecoding: Accelerating Parallel Decoding in Diffusion Large Language Models with Trace Credits" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> presents detailed results corresponding to Figure <a href="#S2.F2" title="Figure 2 ‣ Inference acceleration and decoding strategies. ‣ 2 Related Work ‣ CreditDecoding: Accelerating Parallel Decoding in Diffusion Large Language Models with Trace Credits" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>, including TPS comparisons. Table <a href="#A3.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ C.4 Orthogonality ‣ Appendix C CreditDecoding Supplement ‣ CreditDecoding: Accelerating Parallel Decoding in Diffusion Large Language Models with Trace Credits" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> reports results under the same settings on LLaDA-MoE, further including FP8 quantization.</p>
